FileVault unlock test data
==========================

The encryption_context_plist.*.user_password, recovery_key and
mixed_credentials files are deterministic encryption context fixtures used by
fvde_test_encrypted_metadata. The matching .h files embed the same data for
tests that cannot depend on the process working directory.

Credentials:

* User password: user-TEST
* Recovery key: AAAA-BBBB-CCCC-DDDD-EEEE-FFFF
* Volume master key: 000102030405060708090a0b0c0d0e0f

Regenerate the fixtures with:

  python3 tests/generate_unlock_test_data.py

The generator requires the Python cryptography module.
